00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.790
You've probably heard of
these names like Wealth Front,

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.440
Betterment, Personal Capital.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.000
These are our customers.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.830
These are the guys
who are basically

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:12.580
