00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:18.160
And by the way, if you've
seen the news these days,

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:22.175
ETS are outperforming
most active funds.

00:05:22.175 --> 00:05:23.800
And these guys, the
robo advisers, they

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.600
can charge a
fraction of the cost

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.970
because they have a
much lower cost basis.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.960
We have some of the most
popular mobile brokers

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:34.990
like Robin Hood, who's
making a name for themselves

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:38.590
by offering $0
commission trades.

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:41.800
We have some of the fastest
growing online brokers

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.000
