just making

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:47.890
a script that makes a
direct SQL call to BigQuery

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:52.511
to pull the historical time
series data for gold for--

00:10:52.511 --> 00:10:53.260
its kind of funny.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:57.024
Originally in my
demo was the S&amp;P 500.

00:10:57.024 --> 00:10:59.440
But since Thani's here, I just
changed it five minutes ago

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.742
