Industrial Average.

00:11:01.742 --> 00:11:03.510
[LAUGHING]

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:07.870
For the Dow Jones Industrial
Average and for a gold mining

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:08.680
stock--

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.810
Newport Mining.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:15.340
So let's really do a query,
check the correlations,

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.780
and plot the data.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.850
So you run this thing.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.950
And up pops the quick graph.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:32.290
It shows you-- the red
line, I believe is gold,

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:36.130
green line is the Dow
Jones, and the blue line

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.219
