00:31:14.880 --> 00:31:17.211
So basically searching
through our taxonomy that

00:31:17.211 --> 00:31:19.460
talks about compliance and
embargo and sanctions-- you

00:31:19.460 --> 00:31:21.000
don't have to be an
expert in these things.

00:31:21.000 --> 00:31:22.583
You can actually
leverage our taxonomy

00:31:22.583 --> 00:31:25.730
and build on top of that.

00:31:25.730 --> 00:31:29.300
Imagine being able to
understand the effect of China's

00:31:29.300 --> 00:31:31.480
economic slowdown
across the globe.

00:31:31.480 --> 00:31:34.670
Again, you can mine our content
for key terms, keywords,

00:31:34.670 --> 00:31:38.030
across our taxonomy in terms of
looking for economic slowdown,

00:31:38.030 --> 00:31:40.910
creating a heat map
around that type of stuff,

00:31:40.910 --> 00:31:43.610
and understanding,
whoa, there seems

00:31:43.610 --> 00:31:45.620
to be some really
hot areas in terms

00:31:45.620 --> 00:31:48.620
