of potentially

00:31:48.620 --> 00:31:52.910
the Chinese economic slowdown.

00:31:52.910 --> 00:31:55.640
Imagine being able
to track vaccination

00:31:55.640 --> 00:31:58.790
trends across the globe
with our news content,

00:31:58.790 --> 00:32:01.640
and how does that impact,
for example, investments

00:32:01.640 --> 00:32:03.380
