00:32:03.380 --> 00:32:05.939
Oh, we see the spread of Zika
go across these other regions.

00:32:05.939 --> 00:32:07.730
Do we need to invest
in vaccinations there?

00:32:07.730 --> 00:32:10.400
Are pharma investing in
vaccinations in those kind

00:32:10.400 --> 00:32:12.590
