00:32:12.590 --> 00:32:15.500
So this is just the
tip of the iceberg.

00:32:15.500 --> 00:32:17.365
You can imagine a
lot of different ways

00:32:17.365 --> 00:32:18.740
that you could
leverage this news

00:32:18.740 --> 00:32:22.610
content to really drive how
you guys are doing investment.

00:32:22.610 --> 00:32:25.490
And that's really the
power of this platform

00:32:25.490 --> 00:32:29.930
and what premium news can
really do for your business.

00:32:29.930 --> 00:32:31.960
So we love people to
