we participated in over 6,000
residential transactions

00:37:42.550 --> 00:37:45.700
nationwide-- one transaction
at a time, working with banks

00:37:45.700 --> 00:37:47.530
or working with other parties.

00:37:47.530 --> 00:37:49.240
And it really gives
you an insight

00:37:49.240 --> 00:37:53.650
to understand what goes
on at that level, what

00:37:53.650 --> 00:37:56.080
is in the mindset, where are
there certain life events

00:37:56.080 --> 00:37:58.330
and life actions that
we can break down

00:37:58.330 --> 00:38:01.000
these activities into
and understanding equity,

00:38:01.000 --> 00:38:02.620
understanding
length of ownership.

00:38:02.620 --> 00:38:04.572
Because usually what you
hear is the statistic

00:38:04.572 --> 00:38:06.280
that the National
Association of Realtors

00:38:06.280 --> 00:38:08.620
puts out that a home
sells every seven years.

00:38:08.620 --> 00:38:10.690
Well, let's get more
granular with that

00:38:10.690 --> 00:38:13.720
and let's understand
how we can figure out

00:38:13.720 --> 00:38:17.090
where that information is
going to come into play.

00:38:17.090 --> 00:38:21.010
So what we do is we look at a
classification of understanding

00:38:21.010 --> 00:38:23.620
that sale in a si-month,
12-month, 18-month,

00:38:23.620 --> 00:38:26.020
and a 24-month-plus frame.

00:38:26.020 --> 00:38:28.540
So by bringing in all
of this data together,

00:38:28.540 --> 00:38:30.370
we're able to bring
this data, now

00:38:30.370 --> 00:38:33.284
available on the Google Cloud
as a commercial data set--

00:38:33.284 --> 00:38:35.200
and one of the things
that we do have up there

00:38:35.200 --> 00:38:37.630
is a snippet from our data.

00:38:37.630 --> 00:38:39.400
It's in Alaska, in
Anchorage, where

00:38:39.400 --> 00:38:42.660
we have that classification of
understanding these sales up

00:38:42.660 --> 00:38:43.160
there.

00:38:43.160 --> 00:38:44.200
So take a look.

00:38:44.200 --> 00:38:45.310
Try it out.

00:38:45.310 --> 00:38:46.400
Reach out to us.

00:38:46.400 --> 00:38:48.220
We're happy to discuss
more about what

00:38:48.220 --> 00:38:52.240
we have around that predictive
sale and other attributes

00:38:52.240 --> 00:38:54.580
across the United
States for SFR,

00:38:54.580 --> 00:38:57.070
and we're happy to be
working with Google on this.

00:38:57.070 --> 00:38:57.970
Thank you, guys.

